From 35947e619c2ae17d324e7bd19680e5e94a8305e9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: scada <scada@noreply.codeberg.org>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 18:40:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 30/78] arm64: configs: joan_defconfig: build the GPIO SBU mux
 in

The PMI8998 Type-C connector depends on the SBU mux; with it modular the
port driver defers forever, the controller never gets a data role and
the Android USB gadget fails to start (-ENODEV).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0144VMKxYe33NKa3LLPZNivr
---
 arch/arm64/configs/joan_defconfig | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/joan_defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/joan_defconfig
index f451058cb620..fadbc0d5fd82 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/joan_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/joan_defconfig
@@ -957,7 +957,7 @@ CONFIG_UCSI_PMIC_GLINK=m
 CONFIG_TYPEC_TPS6598X=m
 CONFIG_TYPEC_HD3SS3220=m
 CONFIG_TYPEC_MUX_FSA4480=m
-CONFIG_TYPEC_MUX_GPIO_SBU=m
+CONFIG_TYPEC_MUX_GPIO_SBU=y
 CONFIG_TYPEC_MUX_IT5205=m
 CONFIG_TYPEC_MUX_NB7VPQ904M=m
 CONFIG_TYPEC_MUX_PS883X=m
